"791893150437801","Every morning, I have the privilege of welcoming people to my residence, listening to their concerns, and doing my best to find solutions. And every Wednesday, along with my colleagues Ramke and Beechook, we dedicate our time at the CAB office in Central Flacq to meet our constituents of No.9.

For me, politics has always been about being present and staying connected with the people. Even during the last 10 years in opposition, I never stopped receiving constituents at my doorstep every single day. It’s a tradition I have always upheld because I believe that leaders should never distance themselves from those they serve.

While it’s not always possible to satisfy everyone, I always do my best to help in any way I can. The struggles, the hopes, and the aspirations of every Mauritian matter. And this direct engagement keeps us grounded and focused on what truly counts—serving the people.

I don’t usually post pictures of these daily meetings, as this is simply part of my duty and commitment. But today, someone captured these moments and sent them to me, so I thought of sharing them with you.

A huge thank you to our no.9 team that has been by our side since the very beginning—from the campaign days to today. Your dedication and unwavering support mean everything. 

We will continue to be on the ground, listening, acting, and delivering—because true politics happens among the people, for the people, not behind closed doors.","English","politics","domestic politics","not foreign politics","not resource distribution","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","positive towards democracy","not anti-western","national unity","subgroup unity","Central Flacq","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","no mention of violent group","NOT CODED","GOVERNMENT OPERATIONS"
