"4230494857186087","Today, I received the sad news regarding the demise of a remarkable man, Honourable Kalilou Singhateh, a true patriot whose life and work have left an indelible mark on the fabric of our nation. 

Alhaji Kalilou served as the Minister of Education, and was instrumental in laying the groundwork for an educational system that aimed to ensure accessibility and quality education for all Gambian children.

Beyond his professional achievements, Kalilou was a man of great integrity and compassion. His contributions were felt in the communities he served and the lives he touched. He was a mentor to many and a friend to all, known for his wisdom and gentle guidance.

i exend our condolences to the Singhateh family and all Gambians. 

