Today, President Abdel Fattah El-Sisi received a phone call from the Amir of Tabuk Region, KSA, Prince Fahd Bin Sultan Bin Abdulaziz, who greeted the President on the occasion of Eid al-Fitr, asking Allah to return this occasion on both countries and both the Arab and Islamic nations with all goodness, stability and prosperity.

