"2219755271861234","Cabinet Secretary Hon.Aden Duale held a bilateral with India's Minister for Environmet Forest and Climate Change,H.E. Bhupender Yadav on the margins of the ongoing UNCCD COP 16.

The meeting discussed India's innovative Green Credit Programme, which partners with the private sector to promote environmental action and create community livelihoods. 

