"670811489396319","Cabinet Secretary Hon.Aden Duale today appeared before the Senate Standing Committe on Lands, Environment and Natural Resources chaired by Mombasa Senator Hon. Faki Mohamed at Bunge Towers in Nairobi City .

Speaking at the meeting ,the CS assured the committee of the protection of Karura Forest, contrary to the previously  misleading information that  circulated online.

Hon. Duale said that the carefully planned exercise, implemented in phases of 5,000ha annually, is at the core of the Karura Forest Participatory Forest Management Plan (PFMP) that's overseen jointly by Kenya Forest Service (KFS) and Friends of Karura Forest.

The Ministry is fully committed to the protection of all gazetted forests across the country including Karura Forest  and is firm to resolve and end all forms of illegalities in these protected forests.

While acknowledging the  private sector's immense potential to accelerate Kenya's ambitious climate action due to its unique financial, manpower and technology capabilities,the CS noted that his Ministry in partneship with Safaricom is in the process of fencing Citi Park to resolve the decongestion at Karura Forest.

On waste management, the CS reiterated that the government is obliged to provide a clean and healthy environment to its citizens adding that both County and the National gvts should work jointly to ensure the implementation of the same.

Additionally, Hon. Duale said that in consideration of the recently amended NEMA regulations, his Ministry is in the process of setting up a hotline for Kenyans to call and report any construction of clubs in residential areas.

Hon. Duale was accompanied by Principal Secretaries Dr. Eng. Festus Ng’eno (Environment and Climate Change) and Mr Gitonga Mugambi (Forestry).","English","politics","domestic politics","not foreign politics","resource distribution","national government","specific locality or group","not applicable","Karura Forest","resources not specifically for women","mentions sustainability","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","no mention of the nation or national unity","no mention of specific subgroup","not applicable","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","no mention of violent group","NOT CODED","ENVIRONMENT;GOVERNMENT OPERATIONS"
