"1937456873464174","On September 28, 2024, in Washington, D.C., I had the privilege of accompanying my husband, 3919 His Excellency Julius Maada Bio, at the OBBA USA Fundraiser Dinner and Dance. It was an evening that reinforced the remarkable leadership and dedication he continues to demonstrate, both at home and abroad. 

I extended my profound gratitude for the unwavering support shown to my husband. His leadership, vision, and commitment have been clear from the very beginning since 2018, he has consistently upheld his promises, delivering tangible results and driving transformative change for our nation.

Today, as women are being celebrated globally, it is my husband’s relentless drive to empower women that has allowed this progress. His vision has given women the space to excel, and I am able to serve as First Lady because of his unwavering support. The credit for all that I have achieved belongs to him.

I am who I am because of the environment, opportunity, and support that His Excellency Julius Maada Bio has provided, allowing me to contribute meaningfully to the progress of our country and beyond. Thank you, President Bio, my husband. 

I thank you for your continued trust and support, and I urged everyone to keep standing behind His Excellency as he leads us forward. God bless you all.

