Maalintaan barakeysan waa fursad aan ku xasuusanno naxariista, jacaylka iyo caddaalada uu Nabigu u muujiyay Aadanaha. Waa in aan ku dayano wanaagga iyo dhaqanka suuban ee Nabiga, kuna dayano tilmaamihiisa qiimaha badan.

Waxaan Alle weydiisaneynaa in uu nagu karaameeyo Xuska Nabi Muxamed (NNKH) oo naga yeelo kuwa raaca sunnadiisa. Waxaan Ummadda soomaaliyeed ugu baaqayaa  in ay ilaaliyaan midnimada, wadajirka iyo walaalnimada dhexdooda ah.","Other(Somali)","politics","domestic politics","not foreign politics","not resource distribution","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","national unity","subgroup unity","Muslims","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","religious","no mention of violent group","NOT CODED","GOVERNMENT OPERATIONS"
