Qoyska cusub waxaan Alle uga rajeynayaa  in uu isu barakeeyo oo ay kala helaan nolol wanaagsan iyo farxad waarta.","Other(Somali)","not political","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","no mention of the nation or national unity","no mention of specific subgroup","not applicable","no mention of africa","not applicable","religious","not applicable","NOT CODED","not applicable"
"760318943668592","Innaa lillaahi wa innaa ileyhi Raajicuun. 

Waxaan tacsi tiiraanyo leh u dirayaa qoyska, qaraabada iyo guud ummadda Soomaaliyeed ee uu ka baxay Alle ha u naxariistee Madaxweynihii hore ee Somaliland Marxuum Axmed Maxamed Maxamuud (Siilaanyo) oo caawa ku geeriyooday magaalada Hargaysa.

Waa geeri xanuun badan oo ay si weyn ay u wada dareemeen shacabka Soomaaliyeed meelkasta oo ay joogaan. Alle ha u naxariistee Madaxweyne Siilaanyo, waxa uu door weyn ka soo qaatay dowladnimada Soomaaliya oo uu mas’uuliyado kala duwan ugu soo adeegay, laga soo billaabo dowladdii Rayidka ahayd iyo dowladdii Kacaanka oo uu labo Wasaarad Wasiir kasoo noqday.

Marxuumku waxa aan ku xusuusanaynaa doorkiisii lama ilaawaanka ahaa ee uu kasoo qaatay furitaankii albaabka wadahadallada Dowladda Federaalka Soomaaliya iyo Somaliland si xal waara looga gaaro tabashada walaalaha Gobolada Waqooyi.

Waxaan Alle u weydiinayaa Marxuumka in uu hoygiisa ka yeelo Jannatul Firdowsa, samir iyo iimaanna uu ka siiyo qoyskiisa iyo guud ahaan ummadda Soomaaliyeed ee uu ka geeriyooday.

Innaa lillaahi wa innaa ileyhi Raajicuun.","Other(Somali)","politics","domestic politics","not foreign politics","not resource distribution","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","national unity","subgroup unity","Northern Regions","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","religious","no mention of violent group","NOT CODED","GOVERNMENT OPERATIONS"
"743883528701397","Maanta, waxaan garoonka diyaaradaha ee Aadan Cadde kusoo dhaweeyay qaar ka mid ah geesiyaasha Ciidanka Qaranka Soomaaliyeed iyo xoogagga shacbiga ah ee ku dhaawacmay howlgallada lagu ciribtirayo haraadiga Khawaarijta.

Waxaan naga go’an in ciidamada dhaawacma ay helaan daryeel dhameystiran. Waxay naftooda u huraan difaaca dalka iyo badbaadinta shacabka, waana waajib in aan garab istaagno, daryeelno, una muujino in naf-hurnimadooda aan la iloobi doonin.

Waxaan bogaadinayaa sida geesinimada leh ee halyeeyadan ay ugu huraan naftooda gobanimada iyo xoreynta dadka Soomaaliyeed. Waxaan Alle uga baryayaa inuu siiyo caafimaad degdeg ah, si ay dib ugu soo kabtaan.

Dowladda Federaalka Soomaaliya waxay sii xoojinaysaa qorsheyaasha horumarinta adeegyada caafimaadka ee Ciidanka Xoogga Dalka, iyadoo la ballaarinayo iskaashiga caalamiga ah si loo helo taageero dheeri ah oo lagu daryeelo ciidamada dhaawaca ah. Waa waajib qaran in la hubiyo in geesiyaasheenna ay helaan daryeelka ay mudan yihiin.","Other(Somali)","politics","domestic politics","foreign politics","resource distribution","national government","country-wide","not applicable","not applicable","resources not specifically for women","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","national unity","no mention of specific subgroup","not applicable","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","religious","mentions violent group","NOT CODED","DEFENSE;HEALTH"
"1315028703498035","Innaa lillaahi wa innaa ilayhi raajicuun

Waxaan tacsi tiiraanyo leh u dirayaa qoyskii, qaraabadii, bahda Ciidanka Booliska Soomaaliyeed, iyo guud ahaan ummadda Soomaaliyeed ee uu ka baxay Allaha u naxariistee Janaraal Maxamed Yuusuf Sheekh Cumar (Madaale). 

Geerida Janaraalku waa mid qaran oo si weyn u taabaneysa shacabka Soomaaliyeed iyo hay’adaha amniga dalka. Marxuumku waxa uu door muhiim ah ka soo qaatay dib u dhiska dowladnimada, gaar ahaan horumarinta iyo tayeynta Ciidanka Booliska Soomaaliyeed, isagoo naf iyo niyadba u huray u adeeggida qaranka.

Waxaan Alle uga baryayaa inuu marxuumka naxariistiisa janno ka waraabiyo, ehelkiisii, asxaabtiisii iyo dhammaan shacabka Soomaaliyeedna samir iyo iimaan ka siiyo.","Other(Somali)","politics","domestic politics","not foreign politics","not resource distribution","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","national unity","no mention of specific subgroup","not applicable","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","religious","no mention of violent group","NOT CODED","LAW AND CRIME;GOVERNMENT OPERATIONS"
"24863485099951932","#MaximumProtection Condoms protect against STIs that spread via discharge, such as HIV, gonorrhoea and chlamydia. They also protect against STIs that spread by skin-to-skin contact, such as syphilis, genital herpes and human papillomavirus (HPV) when the lesion occurs in the area covered by the condom.

