"1333379678286796","KROWOR MP PRESENTS CASH, DRIVER'S LICENSE, AND OTHER ITEMS TO CONSTITUENTS

As part of my unwavering commitment to education and youth empowerment in Krowor, I had the honour of facilitating the acquisition of FREE driver's licenses for our hardworking drivers, mechanics, and tricycle owners. This initiative is aimed at equipping them with the legal certification and confidence to operate safely and professionally on our roads.

In addition, I presented financial support to students across various educational levels — from basic school through to SHS and tertiary institutions. This support is a testament to my belief that no child should be left behind due to financial constraints.

I also had the profound honor of presenting internationally recognised certificates awarded by Regional Maritime University (RMU) to another batch of graduates of the RMU's Forklift and Mobile Crane Operation Course.

Some small business owners received sewing machines and a deep freezer to support their businesses.

I deeply appreciate the support and attendance of CEC members, Ward Coordinators, Hon. Assembly Members, Community leaders, beneficiaries, and community members.

Together, we are building a future where education and economic empowerment go hand in hand. 
I remain committed to creating opportunities and removing barriers that hinder progress for the people of Krowor.","English","politics","domestic politics","not foreign politics","resource distribution","national government","specific locality or group","not applicable","Krowor","resources not specifically for women","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","no mention of the nation or national unity","subgroup unity","Krowor","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","no mention of violent group","NOT CODED","EDUCATION;DOMESTIC COMMERCE;LABOR"
