Today, the Ministry of Health took upon itself to lead by example by donating blood.  The Botswana National Blood Transfusion Service (NBTS) mounted its blood donation truck in the Ministry Headquarters area to collect blood to save the nation. The ministry staff responded to the call to donate blood and availed themselves.

Requirements for donating blood are as follows:

16 - 65 years old
In good health 
Weighing 50KG and above
