𝐖𝐚𝐮, 𝐖𝐁𝐆𝐒 — 𝟎𝟑 𝐀𝐩𝐫𝐢𝐥 𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟓 — The National Ministry of Health inaugurated a new Public Health Emergency Operations Centre (PHEOC) in 𝑾𝒂𝒖, 𝑾𝒆𝒔𝒕𝒆𝒓𝒏 𝑩𝒂𝒉𝒓 𝒆𝒍 𝑮𝒉𝒂𝒛𝒂𝒍 𝑺𝒕𝒂𝒕𝒆, to improve regional coordination and preparedness for public health emergencies. 

During the ceremony, 𝐃𝐫. 𝐀𝐧𝐧𝐢𝐧 𝐍𝐠𝐨𝐭 𝐍𝐠𝐨𝐭, #Undersecretary of the National Ministry of Health, highlighted that the #PHEOC is a proactive step to protect communities from health threats and enable responses to outbreaks and disasters. He thanked #WHO and #USAID for their support in establishing the centre.

𝐃𝐫. 𝐊𝐞𝐝𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐝𝐞 𝐂𝐡𝐨𝐧𝐠 𝐌𝐚𝐩𝐮𝐨𝐫, Director General of Preventive Health Services and Emergencies Response, emphasised the importance of collaboration among stakeholders for the centre's success. National and state health officials attended the ceremony.

