"1806903076592419","Ministry of Finance- Pocket of Excellence

The Vice President of the Republic of Botswana and Minister of Finance,  Mr Ndaba Nkosinathi Gaolathe said the Ministry of Finance is the pocket of excellence for the Government of Botswana and that had always been the case since time memorial. He said it does not matter which administration is in government, the Finance Ministry has been known for excellent service delivery to the government and Batswana in General.
Vice President Gaolathe said this during a meet and greet session this morning with members of staff from Ministry Headquarters, Financial Intelligence Agency, Gemvas and Internal Audit following the virtual meeting he had last week with all the Ministry employees including those in outstations.  He insisted that the current crop of employees have the responsibility to maintain let alone surpass the legacy and culture of hospitality they have been known for. Mr Gaolathe noted that his major role is mainly to provide guidance and advice whereas the employees have the responsibility to ensure good service delivery that can only be achieved through unity and teamwork. He implored staff members to be mindful all the time in whatever they do and to ensure there is collective effort. 
