"3324992147683044","Wasiirka Wasaaradda Caafimaadka iyo Daryeelka Bulshada XFS Xildhibaan  Dr. Ali Haji Adam oo ka mid ah Madaxda ka qaybgalay Munaabasadda Daahfurka Nidaamka Dhijitaalka ee Dad-dhigidda Mideysan ayaa bidhaamiyay doorka bahda Caafimaadka ee adeegyada Dad-dhigidda.","Other(Somali)","politics","domestic politics","not foreign politics","not resource distribution","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","no mention of the nation or national unity","no mention of specific subgroup","not applicable","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","no mention of violent group","NOT CODED","GOVERNMENT OPERATIONS;HEALTH"
"2510188696030312","𝐖𝐚𝐬𝐢𝐢𝐫𝐤𝐚 𝐂𝐚𝐚𝐟𝐢𝐦𝐚𝐚𝐝𝐤𝐚 𝐨𝐨 𝐱𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐠𝐚 𝐤𝐚 𝐣𝐚𝐫𝐞𝐲 𝐂𝐓 𝐒𝐜𝐚𝐧 𝐜𝐮𝐬𝐮𝐛 𝐨𝐨 𝐥𝐚𝐠𝐚 𝐡𝐢𝐫𝐠𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐲𝐞𝐲 𝐈𝐬𝐛𝐢𝐭𝐚𝐚𝐥𝐤𝐚 𝐁𝐚𝐧𝐚𝐚𝐝𝐢𝐫.

Muqdisho 11 Novenber 2024; Wasiirka Caafimaadka iyo daryeelka bulshada Xukuumadda Federaalka Soomaaliya Dr. Cali Xaaji Aadan ayaa maanta xariga ka jaray CT scan casri ah oo lagu soo kordhiyay Isbitaalka Hooyada iyo dhallaanka ee Banaadir kaas oo loogu adeegi doono bulshada gaar ahaan hooyada iyo dhallaanka.

CT Iskaankaan lagu soo kordhiyay isbitaal Banaadir ayaa waxaa loogu talogalay in lagu ogaado go'aana looga qaato xaalado kala duwan sida dhaawacyada Madaxa, jajabka lafaha, xaaladaha ay caruurta ku dhashaan ( congenital anomallies), Burooyinka oo dhan sida kuwa ku dhaca Riximka-Minka iyo Ugxan sidayaasha dumarka  iyo Xaalada kaloo badan, waxaana xarig jarkiisa ka qeyb galay xildhibaano, agaasimyaasha isbitaalada danta guud,Ururka Raajooyinka iyo qaar kamida bahda Caafimaadka. 

Agaasimaha guud ee Isbitaalka Hooyada iyo dhallaanka Banaadir  Dr Fartuun Shariif Maxamed  ayaa xustay, in Isbitaalka uu noqday kii ugu horeeyay ee danguud ka shaqeeya ee soo kordhiya CT Scan oo ah qalab casri ah oo kasoo qeyb weyn kaqaadan doono tayada iyo  kor uqaadidda adeegga uu bixiyo Hospital.

Wasiirka Wasaaradda Caafimaadka iyo daryeelka bulshada Xukuumadda Federaalka Soomaaliya Dr Cali Xaaji ayaa tilmaamay in CT Iskaanka lagu soo kordhiyay Isbitaal Banaadir uu qeyb ka yahay dadaalo ay Wasaaraddu ku dayactireyso kuna qalabeyneyso ilaa iyo sideed Isbitaal oo ah kuwa danta guud.

