"1879252042980229","𝐖𝐚𝐬𝐢𝐢𝐫𝐤𝐚 𝐂𝐚𝐚𝐟𝐢𝐦𝐚𝐚𝐝𝐤𝐚 𝐨𝐨 𝐛𝐨𝐨𝐪𝐝𝐞𝐲 𝐝𝐡𝐚𝐚𝐰𝐚𝐜𝐲𝐨 𝐱𝐚𝐚𝐥𝐚𝐝𝐨𝐨𝐝𝐚 𝐂𝐚𝐚𝐟𝐢𝐦𝐚𝐚𝐝 𝐥𝐚𝐠𝐮 𝐝𝐚𝐛𝐢𝐢𝐛𝐚𝐲𝐨 𝐈𝐬𝐛𝐢𝐭𝐚𝐚𝐥𝐤𝐚 𝐗𝐨𝐨𝐠𝐠𝐚.

Wasiirka Wasaaradda Caafimaadka iyo Daryeelka Bulshada Xukuumadda Federaalka Soomaaliya Dr. Ali Haji Adam ayaa booqday Geesiyada ciidanka Qalabka sida ee xaaladooda Caafimaad lagu dabiibayo Isbitaalka Dhexe ee Ciidanka xoogga dalka isagoo kormeerkiisa diiradda ku saarey in ay heleen daryeel Caafimaad oo ku filan.

Dhaawacyadan oo laga keeney deegaanada Hirshabeelle gaar ahaan Gobolka Hiiraan ayaa kusoo dhaawacmey howlgalada dalka looga sifeynayo Khawaarijta haraadiga ah ee wali ku harsan deegaanada Hirshabeelle oo markale dib looga billaabey baacsiga Khawaarijta sii dabar go'eysa.

Wasaaradda Caafimaadka iyo daryeelka bulshada Xukuumadda Federaalka Soomaaliya waxaa ka go'an garab istaagga Ciidanka Xoogga dalka iyo dadka deegaanka oo iyaguna qeyb lixaad leh ka qaadanaya howlgalada lagu dabar jarayo Khawaarijta. 

Booqashada Isbitaalka Xoogga dalka ee Wasiirka Caafimaadka wasiirka waxaa ku wehliyay qaar kamid ah Wasiirada Maamulka Hirshabeelle iyo xubno kale.","Other(Somali)","politics","domestic politics","not foreign politics","resource distribution","national government","specific locality or group","not applicable","Hirshabelle, Hiran","resources not specifically for women","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","no mention of the nation or national unity","subgroup unity","Hirshabelle","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","mentions violent group","NOT CODED","DEFENSE;HEALTH"
"2.44006E+15","Soo jeedinta warbixinada kala duwan iyo doodaha daaran xalalka caqabadaha Caafimaadka Soomaaliya ayaa si habsami leh ugu socda maalintii labaad Teendhada Afisyooni ee magaalada Muqdisho oo uu ka socdo Shirka qiimeynta iyo dib u eegista Caafimaadka dalkeena.","Other(Somali)","politics","domestic politics","not foreign politics","not resource distribution","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","no mention of the nation or national unity","no mention of specific subgroup","not applicable","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","no mention of violent group","NOT CODED","HEALTH"
"1341945637510465","Wasiir ku xigeenka Wasaaradda Caafimaadka iyo daryeelka bulshada Xukuumadda Federaalka Soomaaliya Xildhibaan Dr <redacted_mention> ayaa kulan miro-dhal ah la yeeshey Danjiraha Turkiga ee Soomaaliya iyagoo ka wada hadley xoojinta iskaashiga dhinaca Caafimaadka ee labada dal.

Kulanka waxaa diiradda lagu saaray, kobcinta wadashaqeynta Caafimaadka ee labada dal, Xoojinta tababarka Caafimaadka iyo dhisidda awoodda xirfadeed, horumarinta kaabeyaasha Caafimaadka, taageerada Isbitaallada, dardargelinta sil-siladda sahayda Caafimaadka iyo helitaanka daawooyinka muhiimka ah.

Turkiga ayaa ah saaxiib istiraatiiji ah oo si hagar la’aan ah u garab taagan horumarinta caafimaadka iyo adeegyada bulshada ee Soomaaliya. Waxaan rajeyneynaa sii xoojinta iskaashigan si loo horumariyo adeegyada caafimaadka ee dalka.

#Soomaaliya #Turkiga #IskaashigaCaafimaadka #WasaaraddaCaafimaadka #WadajirAyaanUGuuleysanaynaa

