"772504642230417","President Dr Nangolo Mbumba to Undertake Working Visit to the Republic of Ghana 

His Excellency Dr. Nangolo Mbumba, President of the Republic of Namibia, will undertake a Working Visit to the Republic of Ghana at the invitation of the Government of the Republic of Ghana and H.E. John Mahama, President - Elect of Ghana. During the working visit, President Nangolo Mbumba will attend the inauguration of H.E. John Mahama, President-Elect of the Republic of Ghana. 

Namibia and Ghana share a longstanding bond of friendship and solidarity, which dates back to Namibia’s struggle for independence. The two countries enjoy excellent bilateral relations and strong commercial ties, including beef exports from Namibia to Ghana. The Working Visit presents an opportunity to further deepen the strong bilateral and trade relations between Namibia and Ghana. 

President Nangolo Mbumba will depart for Ghana on Monday, 6 January 2025, and return to Namibia on Thursday, 9 January 2025.","English","politics","not domestic politics","foreign politics","not resource distribution","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","no mention of the nation or national unity","no mention of specific subgroup","not applicable","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","no mention of violent group","NOT CODED","INTERNATIONAL AFFAIRS;FOREIGN TRADE"
