"787602690783239","Muqdisho, Arbaco 18 Sebtembar 2024: – Golaha Wasiirrada Xukuumadda Jamhuuriyadda Federaalka Soomaaliya oo caawa kulan isugu yimid, ayaa lagu ansixiyey soo-jeedinta Wasaaradda Arrimaha Dibedda iyo Xiriirka Caalamiga ah ee magacaabista labo kamid ah Danjireyaasha Soomaaliya ku matalaya dalalka caalamka, oo kala ah:

1. Mudane Cabdixakiin Maxamed Axmed (Dhoobo-daareed) –  Safiir

2. Mudane Yuusuf Axmed Jeego – Safiir 

Kulanka oo uu guddoominayey Ra’iisul Wasaaraha Xukuumadda Jamhuuriyadda Federaalka Soomaaliya Xamsa Cabdi Barre, ayaa sidoo kale lagu ansixiyey Siyaasadda habraaca Qaran ee warbixinta iyo dabagalka xuquuqul insaanka, taas oo muhiimad gaar ah siinaysa ilaalinta iyo horumarinta xuquuqda aadanaha ee Soomaaliya. Siyaasaddan cusub ayaa la filayaa in ay kaalin weyn ka qaadato xoojinta hufnaanta iyo dabagalka ku aaddan xaaladaha xuquuqda aadanaha ee dalka. 

Golaha Wasiirrada ayaa lagu soo bandhigay warbixin faah-faahsan oo la xiriirta dardargelinta qorshaha Isbeddelka Qaranka (NTP), kaas oo lagu taageerayo horumarinta nidaamka dowliga ah iyo kobcinta dhaqaalaha dalka.  

Qorshahani wuxuu xoojinayaa isku xirnaanta hey’adaha dowladda, wuxuuna horseedayaa in la helo nidaam hufan oo lagula socdo fulinta iyo horumarinta siyaasadaha qaranka, iyada oo la hubinayo in dhammaan qorshayaasha iyo barnaamijyada dowladda ay waafaqsan yihiin yoolalka horumarineed ee dalka. 

Khubaro ku xeeldheer arrimaha qorsheynta iyo maamulka dowladda ayaa golaha u soo bandhigay qaababka ugu habboon ee dalka looga hirgelin karo hannaanka NTP, kaas oo diiradda saaraya kobcinta dhaqaalaha, hagaajinta adeegyada bulshada, iyo xoojinta maamulka hay’adaha dowladda si loo gaaro horumar waara. 

Sidoo kale, Wasaaradaha Amniga Gudaha iyo Gaashaandhigga ayaa golaha ka siiyey warbixinno la xiriira xaaladda amniga iyo dadaallada lagu xasilinayo dalka ee ka dhanka ah kooxaha Khawaarijta,  iyada oo la xoojiyey qorshayaasha lagu sugayo amniga iyo ciribtirka kooxaha argaggixisada.","Other(Somali)","politics","domestic politics","foreign politics","not resource distribution","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","no mention of the nation or national unity","no mention of specific subgroup","not applicable","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","mentions violent group","NOT CODED","GOVERNMENT OPERATIONS;DEFENSE;INTERNATIONAL AFFAIRS"
"1439314340493677","Ra'iisul Wasaare Xamsa oo kormeeray xarunta lagu diyaarinayo qoraalka Qorshaha Isbeddelka Qaranka

Muqdisho, 30 Oktoobar, 2024: — Ra’iisul Wasaaraha Xukuumadda Federaalka Soomaaliya, Mudane Xamsa Cabdi Barre, ayaa kormeer shaqo ku tagey xarunta diyaarinta Qorshaha Isbeddelka Qaranka (NTP 2025 – 2029), oo si habsami leh uga socda xarunta Hangarka Afisyoone.

Ra'iiul Wasaaraha ayaa warbixin ka dhagaystay Khubarrada ku howlan qorista Qorshaha Isbeddelka Qaranka ee 2025-2029, wuxuuna kormeeray Sheybaarrada kala duwan ee ay shaqadu ka socoto isagoo ku ammaanay howsha muhiimka ah ee ay Qaranka u hayaan. 

Ra’iisul Wasaaraha ayaa intii uu ku sugnaa xarunta, waxa uu ka qaybgalay doodwadaag wax ku ool ah oo ay yeesheen Wasaaradda Caafimaadka, Dhaqaatiirta iyo Ganacsatada kaas oo looga hadlayay muhiimadda ay leedahay in qeybaha bulshada oo dhan ay door ku yeeshaan, diyaarinta Qorshaha Isbeddelka Qaranka.

Ra’iisul Wasaaraha ayaa sheegay in Xukuumadda uu hogaamiyo ee DanQaran ay doonayso in dalkeena loo jiheeyo dhanka horumarka, tayeynta hey’adaha dowladda iyo nidaamka casriyeynta oo wax badan ka beddeli doona qorshaha la doonayo in Qaranka lagu horumariyo.

Mudane Xamsa Cabdi Barre, waxa uu intaa raaciyay in dib u eegis  lagu samaynayo dhismaha iyo sharciyada Ha’yaddaha fulinta si dalkeenu ula jaanqaado dunida horumartay, iyadoo qorshuhuna yahay in Xukuumadda DanQaran ay dalka ku hogaamiso wax-qabad muuqda oo bulshada u riyaaqdo.

— DHAMMAAD —

Wixii Faah-faahin ah kala xiriir
Afhayeenka Xukuumadda, ahna Agaasimaha Warfaafinta iyo Xiriirka Dadweynaha XRW
Farxaan Maxamed Jimcaale
