Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed traveled to Arba Minch to celebrate the 19th Nations, Nationalities, and Peoples Day on December 8, 2024.

In addition to partaking in this important national commemorative program celebrating our diversity, during his visit, the Prime Minister toured several key sites, including a fruit nursery, the Bounty of the Basket initiative projects, Dine for Ethiopia project review, ongoing corridor development efforts, and Nech Sar National Park. These visits highlighted the city's advancements in agricultural productivity, urban infrastructure, and tourism development—critical pillars for driving economic growth in the city and the broader region

