"1457039682182102","Uyu munsi mu karere ka Gasabo, Minisitiri  Uwimana Consolee, yatangije icyumweru cyahariwe ubuzima bw'umwana n'umubyeyi ku nsanganyamatsiko: Hehe n'Igwingira: Twite ku buzima bw'umubyeyi utwite, umwana, umwangavu, imirire n'isuku, dukingiza abana inkingo zose.

Ni icyumweru cyatangiye kuri uyu wa 13 Mutarama kikazasoza kuwa 17 Mutarama 2025. Hateganyijwe ibikorwa bitandukanye birimo guha abana ikinini cy'inzoka no guha inkingo abana bacikanwe n'ibindi bikorwa bigamije guteza imbere ubuzima bw'umwana n'umubyeyi.

Minisitiri  Uwimana Consolee yavuze ko mu Rwanda hatewe intambwe ishimishije ku buzima bw’umubyeyi n’umwana bigaragazwa n’imibare y’igabanuka ry’impfu z’ababyeyi n’abana, abana bafite imirire mibi asaba gukomeza ubutafanye mu kurandura Igwingira n’ikibazo cy’inda ziterwa abangavu nka bimwe mu bibazo bikibangamiye umwana n'umubyeyi.

Atanga ubutumwa, Minisitiri  Uwimana Consolee yasabye abagore batwite kwitabira serivisi zo kwa muganga, bisuzumisha inshuro 8 nkuko biteganywa, kubyarira kwa muganga, kwihutira kujya kwa muganga cyangwa ku mujyanama w’Ubuzima igihe agize ikibazo, yibutsa Ababyeyi gukingiza abana inkingo zose.

 Minisitiri  Uwimana Consolee yasabye kurushaho kwita ku mirire y’abana n’ababyeyi batwite tubashakira indyo yuzuye, tubarinda imirire mibi. Ibi byose dusabwa kubikomatanya no kugira isuku mugutegura ibyo turya, gusukura amazi yo kunywa, kugira isuku ku mubiri wacu no mungo zacu.","Other(Kinyarwanda)","politics","domestic politics","not foreign politics","resource distribution","national government","specific locality or group","not applicable","Gasabo district","resources for women","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","no mention of the nation or national unity","subgroup unity","Gasabo district","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","no mention of violent group","NOT CODED","HEALTH"
