"1323585789323714","The bilateral agreement on Carbon Trading between Zambia and Switzerland moves forward.

Minister of Green Economy and Environment Mike Mposha engaged in a constructive dialogue with Ambassador Stéphane Rey regarding Article 6 of the Paris Agreement and potential future bilateral agreements in the environmental sector. The Minister confirmed to the Ambassador that the Ministry is focused on accelerating carbon trading and effectively implementing Article 6. This partnership reinforces Zambia and Switzerland's joint commitment to clean energy and sustainable development. 

