"659179506876238","WORLD VISION MALAWI SHOOTS GOVERNMENT IN THE ARM. 
Children with disabilities to benefit.

On Thursday, the Deputy Minister of Health, Hon. Noah Chimpeni, MP, officially received a donation of 340 special wheelchairs for kids, hospital beds, and other medical supplies worth approximately K700 million.

Speaking when he received the donation, the Deputy Minister expressed the Ministry's gratitude to World Vision Malawi for the kind gesture.

