"1237892414572542","Minister of Information, Communication and Technology Savannah Maziya, accompanied by Turkmenistan’s Minister of Communication Hajymyrat Hudayguliyev, has toured Aydyn Gijeler, one of Turkmenistan's high-tech manufacturing plants.

