The Executive of the Special Economic Zones Authority (SEZA), led by Acting CEO Ms. Tapiwa Masie, met with representatives of the Toyota Tsusho Corporation (TTC) at the SEZA head office today.

Toyota Tsusho Corporation is a trading, investment and business operations subsidiary of Toyota Group headquartered in Nagoya,Japan.

It operates car assembly plants in countries like Rwanda, Nigeria, Ghana, Egypt, Kenya and South Africa; with a strong sales and distribution network across the continent.

