"2823975451134259","UNHCR Regional Director for Southern Africa, Ms. Chasa Kapaya, recently paid a courtesy call on the Assistant Minister of Justice and Correctional Services of Botswana, Hon. Augustine Nyatanga.

Their meeting underscored the commitment of the United Nations High Commissioner for Refugees (UNHCR) to promote collaboration and dialogue on issues related to refugees and stateless individuals across Southern Africa.

 Ms. Kapaya expressed gratitude for Botswana's longstanding tradition of hospitality towards refugees, noting the country’s commitment to providing sanctuary to those in need. 

