"1170483054935292","اجتمع السيد الرئيس عبد الفتاح السيسي، اليوم، مع السيد ""هنري بوبار""، رئيس مجلس إدارة شركة ""ألستوم الفرنسية العالمية""، وذلك بحضور الدكتور مصطفى مدبولي رئيس مجلس الوزراء، والفريق كامل الوزير نائب رئيس مجلس الوزراء للتنمية الصناعية ووزير الصناعة والنقل. 

وصرح المتحدث الرسمي باسم رئاسة الجمهورية بأن اللقاء شهد استعراضاً للموقف التنفيذي لعدد من المشروعات التي تنفذها الشركة الفرنسية في مصر بمجالات النقل المختلفة، بالإضافة إلى الجهود المبذولة لتوطين صناعات السكك الحديدية في مصر، كما تمت مناقشة آخر المستجدات المتعلقة بإنشاء مجمع ""ألستوم"" الصناعي بمدينة برج العرب، والذي سيضم مصنعين، الأول لإنتاج الأنظمة الكهربائية ومكونات السكك الحديدية، والثاني لإنتاج الوحدات المتحركة بمختلف أنواعها، مما يسهم في تلبية إحتياجات السوق المحلي والتصدير لدول الشرق الأوسط وأفريقيا.

وأضاف السفير محمد الشناوي، المتحدث الرسمي، أن الإجتماع تناول أيضًا متابعة تطورات مشروع الخط السادس لمترو أنفاق القاهرة الكبرى، في إطار التوسع في وسائل النقل الجماعي الأخضر المستدام، وإستكمال شبكة المترو لتقديم خدمات عالية الجودة للمواطنين. كما ناقش الإجتماع آخر المستجدات المتعلقة بالمباحثات الجارية بشأن إدارة وتشغيل وصيانة مشروع المونوريل بشرق وغرب النيل.

وأوضح المتحدث الرسمي أن السيد الرئيس قد شدد على ضرورة الإنتهاء من تنفيذ كافة المشروعات المذكورة وفق الجداول الزمنية المحددة، بما يحقق رؤية الدولة في تطوير قطاع النقل وتوطين الصناعة.

———————

Today, President Abdel Fattah El-Sisi met with Chairman and CEO of Alstom Group, Mr. Henri Poupart-Lafarge. The meeting was attended by Prime Minister, Dr. Moustafa Madbouly and Deputy Prime Minister for Industrial Development and Minister of Transport and Industry, Lieutenant-General Kamel El-Wazir.

Spokesman for the Presidency, Ambassador Mohamed El-Shennawy, said the meeting focused on work progress in projects implemented by the French company in various transport sectors in Egypt, alongside efforts to localize railway industries. The discussion included the latest developments regarding the construction of the Alstom industrial complex in Borg El Arab city, which will house two factories. The first for the production of electrical systems and railway components, and the second for the production of mobile units of various types, thereby contributing to meeting the needs of the local market and exporting to the Middle East and Africa.

The meeting also focused on progress of the Sixth Line of the Cairo Metro, as part of efforts toward the expansion of sustainable green mass transit systems, and the completion of the metro network to provide high-quality services to the citizens. The discussion also touched on progress in ongoing negotiations concerning the management, operation, and maintenance of the monorail project in both East and West Nile.

The President emphasized the importance of completing all the aforementioned projects according to the specified timelines, in line with the country's vision to develop the transport sector and localize the industry.","English;Arabic","politics","domestic politics","foreign politics","resource distribution","national government;other state","specific locality or group","not applicable","Borg-El Arab city","resources not specifically for women","mentions climate change","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","national unity","subgroup unity","people living in Borg El Arab city","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","no mention of violent group","not specifically patriotic","TRANSPORTATION;DOMESTIC COMMERCE;ECONOMY"
"938303565857277","PR recebe Senadora norte-americana de ascendência cabo-verdiana Liz Miranda

A Senadora norte-americana de ascendência cabo-verdiana, Liz Miranda, é recebida esta manhã, às 11h30, por Sua Excelência, o Presidente da República, José Maria Neves, no quadro da visita que ela efetua ao nosso país, desde o dia 03 de fevereiro.

Representante do 2.º Distrito de Suffolk, e que envolve os bairros de Dorchester, Mattapan, Hyde Park, Mission Hill, Jamaica Plain, Roslindale, South End, Fenway, entre outros, no Senado de Massachussets desde 2022, Liz Miranda tem se destacado como uma das mais proeminentes líderes na comunidade cabo-verdiana naquele Estado.

Liz Miranda, recorda-se, foi a principal dinamizadora da grande receção ao Presidente da República, pela Governadora de Massachussets, Maura Haley, aquando da primeira Presidência na Diáspora realizada pelo Chefe de Estado cabo-verdiano. 
Entre as causas por ela defendida estão a migração, a justiça ambiental, justiça económica e saúde materna, todas bandeiras que tocam a sensibilidade do Presidente da República. 

O encontro com o Chefe de Estado será, assim, uma oportunidade de as partes trocarem ideias sobre os desafios ligados á integração da comunidade cabo-verdiana nas Terras do Tio Sam e às relações entre o nosso país e aquele estado e os Estados unidos, em geral.","Portuguese","politics","domestic politics","foreign politics","not resource distribution","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","mentions sustainability","positive towards the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","national unity","subgroup unity","Cape Verdean community in Massachisetts ","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","no mention of violent group","not specifically patriotic","IMMIGRATION;INTERNATIONAL AFFAIRS;CIVIL RIGHTS"
