"1361478489350062","Ministro do Mar conclui visita à Brava com anúncios de melhorias para o setor das pescas

O Ministro do Mar, Eng.º Jorge Santos, concluiu ontem, na localidade de Furna, uma visita de três dias à região Fogo e Brava. 

A agenda, iniciada no domingo, permitiu-lhe contactar de perto as comunidades piscatórias e as autoridades locais, ouvindo preocupações e recolhendo contributos para o fortalecimento do setor das pescas.

Tal como no dia anterior, em Lomba-Tantum, o Ministro manteve em Furna um diálogo aberto com pescadores e peixeiras, abordando diversos aspetos da atividade marítima, tendo reiterado o compromisso do Governo em apoiar soluções para os desafios apresentados. Entre os temas destacados estiveram o isolamento da ilha e o impacto na circulação de pessoas e produtos de pesca; a necessidade de reforçar a ligação marítima Brava–Fogo–Praia; e a importância de acelerar o processo de motorização dos botes.

Antes de chegar a Furna, o governante visitou Fajã d’Água, onde, num breve encontro com pescadores, incentivou a comunidade a aproveitar os editais disponíveis para candidatura a linhas de apoio.

Já em Furna, além da reunião com a comunidade piscatória, o Ministro anunciou a instalação de uma máquina de gelo, resposta a uma reivindicação local e que reforçará as condições de conservação do pescado.

No regresso a São Filipe, o Ministro visitou ainda os trabalhos de desassoreamento do porto de Vale dos Cavaleiros e manteve contactos com a ENAPOR, acompanhando de perto os investimentos em curso na infraestrutura portuária.","Portuguese","politics","domestic politics","not foreign politics","resource distribution","national government","specific locality or group","not applicable","Furna; Fajã d'Água; Vale dos Cavaleiros; Brava Island; Fogo ","resources for women","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","no mention of the nation or national unity","subgroup unity","fishing communities of Furna, Fajã d'Água' Lomba-Tantum, Brava Island","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","no mention of violent group","not specifically patriotic","AGRICULTURE;TRANSPORTATION;PUBLIC LANDS"
"2100175637387492","His Majesty King Mswati III has expressed the country’s full preparedness to receive more investors from Italy and has assured would-be investors of Eswatini's support  and cooperation as they set up their businesses in the country.

Speaking to several companies that had paid him a courtesy call after an Eswatini-hosted business forum yesterday, His Majesty expressed his appreciation to each of the companies that set aside time to attend the seminar.

The King commended emaSwati who had played a role in identifying partnerships with potential investors in the various sectors, which he described as key for both the economic development and return on investment for the companies, as well as attainment of the first world status goal.

He invited the experts of the various companies that had attended the business seminar to help the kingdom shape its future, not only in agriculture but in ICT, commerce and many other areas.

The businesspeople who met the king included energy producers, project management consultants, vehicle engine manufacturers and a marketing and relations company, among others.","English","politics","domestic politics","foreign politics","not resource distribution","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","no mention of democracy","not anti-western","national unity","no mention of specific subgroup","not applicable","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","no mention of violent group","not specifically patriotic","DOMESTIC COMMERCE;ECONOMY;ENERGY"
"936908298695716","كشف رئيس الحكومة عزيز أخنوش، خلال عرض قدمه بجلسة عمومية بالبرلمان، حول موضوع ""السياسة العامة المرتبطة بترسيخ مقومات الإنصاف والحماية الاجتماعية""، أن الحكومة خصّصت غلافا ماليا مهما لتنفيذ برنامج ""الدعم الاجتماعي المباشر""، يقدّر بـ 26,5 مليار درهم برسم السنة الجارية، في أفق بلوغ 29 مليار درهم بحلول سنة 2026. مسجلا أن نسبة الأسر المستفيدة بلغت حوالي 4 مليون أسرة، تضم حوالي 12 مليون مواطن، فيما تجاوز عدد الأطفال المستفيدين 5,5 مليون طفل، في الوقت الذي استفاد أكثر من مليون شخص تفوق أعمارهم 60 سنة، من دعم اجتماعي شهري، عبارة عن منح جزافية بمثابة مدخول يحفظ كرامة كبار السن.","Arabic","politics","domestic politics","not foreign politics","resource distribution","national government","country-wide","not applicable","not applicable","resources not specifically for women","not applicable","no mention of the US","no mention of the Russia","no mention of the China","no mention of the UN","no mention of the IMF","positive towards democracy","not anti-western","national unity","no mention of specific subgroup","not applicable","no mention of africa","no mention of political opponents","no mention of religion","no mention of violent group","not specifically patriotic","SOCIAL WELFARE;ECONOMY;CIVIL RIGHTS"
